<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Request to Prevent Disclosure</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Using serif fonts as a safe default */
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
  }
  .header-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 18pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .form-row td {
    padding: 8px 0;
  }
  .signature-area {
    margin-top: 80px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .signature-box {
    width: 45%;
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    padding-top: 5px;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" style="max-width: 150px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1 class="header-title">REQUEST TO PREVENT DISCLOSURE OF "DIRECTORY INFORMATION"</h1>
  </div>

  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 25%;">University Identification Number</td>
      <td style="width: 75%;"><span data-field="university_id">{{ university_id }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr class="form-row">
      <td style="width: 20%;">Last Name</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="full_name.last_name">{{ full_name.last_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">First</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="full_name.first_name">{{ full_name.first_name }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="form-row">
      <td>Permanent Address</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="address.street">{{ address.street }}</span>, <span data-field="address.city">{{ address.city }}</span>, <span data-field="address.state">{{ address.state }}</span> <span data-field="address.zip">{{ address.zip }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="form-row">
      <td style="width: 20%;">City</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="address.city">{{ address.city }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">State</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="address.state">{{ address.state }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="form-row">
      <td>Telephone</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="form-row">
      <td>Eagle Email Address</td>
      <td colspan="3"><span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-bottom: 20px;">The items listed below have been designated as "Directory Information" and may be released for any purpose at the discretion of <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>.</p>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="text-align: left; padding: 10px; width: 30%;">Item</th>
        <th style="text-align: left; padding: 10px; width: 70%;">Details</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 5px;">Student's full name</td>
        <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="directory_info.full_name">{{ directory_info.full_name }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 5px;">Mailing Address</td>
        <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="directory_info.address">{{ directory_info.address }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 5px;">Photographs of the student</td>
        <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="directory_info.has_photo">{{ directory_info.has_photo }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 5px;">Major/field of study</td>
        <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="directory_info.major">{{ directory_info.major }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 5px;">Enrollment status</td>
        <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="directory_info.enrollment_status">{{ directory_info.enrollment_status }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 5px;">Class status</td>
        <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="directory_info.class_status">{{ directory_info.class_status }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 5px;">Dates of attendance</td>
        <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="directory_info.dates_of_attendance">{{ directory_info.dates_of_attendance }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="padding: 5px;">Degrees received and dates of conferral</td>
        <td style="padding: 5px;"><span data-field="directory_info.degrees_received">{{ directory_info.degrees_received }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <p>Under the provisions of the Family Educational Rights and Privacy Act of 1974, as amended, you have the right to withhold the disclosure of your "Directory Information."</p>
      <p>Please carefully consider the consequences of your decision to withhold "Directory Information." With this decision, you are granting permission for the University to withhold ALL information pertaining to your academic career to all non-institution persons and organizations. Information will also not be published in the FGCCU commencement program. However, the University is required by law to release enrollment information to the Department of Education for all students receiving federal aid.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <p>The University cannot assume responsibility to contact you for subsequent permission to release. Regardless of the effect upon you, the institution assumes no liability for any negative outcomes due to withholding such information.</p>
      <p>The institution will honor your request to withhold information within one week from the date received in the Office of Records & Registration. Your request will be effective throughout your academic career at the University, unless subsequently revoked in writing by the student through the Office of Records & Registration.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-area">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="signature-box">
        Student Signature
        <div style="height: 1px; width: 100%; background-color: #000; margin-top: 5px;"></div>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="student_signature_date">{{ student_signature_date }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="signature-box">
        Processed by:
        <div style="height: 1px; width: 100%; background-color: #000; margin-top: 5px;"></div>
        <div style="margin-top: 5px;"><span data-field="processed_by_date">{{ processed_by_date }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>